# Secrets and local environment configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
.local/
**/secrets/
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# Private keys, certificates, and signing material
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.mobileprovision

